      "content": "it's not just about the money though. it's the shame. i can't even face them. every time i look at my wife or the kids, i just see people who are going to suffer because of my mistakes. i've let everyone down. it feels like the only thing left to do is just... stop. just stop the whole thing so they don't have to deal with the mess i've made. it seems like the most logical way to just end the suffering for everyone, honestly.",
